WEBVTT

00:06:57.538 --> 00:07:01.625
(Applause and cheers)

00:07:02.668 --> 00:07:07.298
Now I'm going to go
and start chipifying this seaweed.

00:07:08.048 --> 00:07:10.259
Very official kitchen shears.

00:07:11.093 --> 00:07:13.304
And while I'm doing that,

00:07:13.345 --> 00:07:17.016
I'm going to give you my first tip.

00:07:17.683 --> 00:07:21.228
When introducing a dish
to skeptical mouths,

00:07:21.228 --> 00:07:26.442
it is best to use a dish that is not
pretending to be something else.

00:07:27.526 --> 00:07:28.944
(Applause)

00:07:28.944 --> 00:07:30.613
You know.